OL,3,GNEWSAFans 'deserve better' than derby
OL,4,Abubble policing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to restrict away fans'
OL,7,Ftravel to official club coaches for a
OL,8,Fderby match less than 15 miles away has
OL,9,Fbeen dubbed a "backwards step for
OL,10,Fpolicing" by a fans group.
OL,12,FSunderland's Premier League trip to
OL,13,FNewcastle on 6 December has been
OL,14,Fdesignated a "bubble fixture" after
OL,15,FNorthumbria Police said the behaviour
OL,16,Fof a minority at the same fixture last
OL,17,FMarch created a "clear and significant
OL,18,Frisk of harm". At the time the force
OL,19,Fsaid the match had passed "largely
OL,20,Fwithout incident".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
