OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFans 'deserve better' than derby
OL,4,Abubble policing
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Rose, vice-chair of Red and White
OL,7,FArmy (RAWA), said fans "deserve better"
OL,8,Fand claimed: "It strips away supporter
OL,9,Ffreedoms."
OL,11,FMore than 2,000 tickets have been
OL,12,Fallocated to Sunderland for the derby.
